  "notes": "Piano solo on ONE grand staff (brace). A correct conversion yields exactly ONE part \"Piano\" with 2 staves; it must NOT be split into right/left hand parts, and the second right-hand voice in bars 13-16 must stay inside the piano part (voice 2), not become a new part. DAMAGE (halftone): Page reproduced through a clustered-dot halftone screen (offset reprint of a photo of the page) and re-scanned by point sampling, giving moire: every stroke and the paper tone are made of dots. mild 150 lpi/45 deg, scan 110 lpi/15 deg with 0.97 rescale, severe 85 lpi/30 deg, 18% paper tone, 0.93 rescale + 0.7 deg rotation and JPEG 50. TRUTH LIMITATIONS: The 0.97 / 0.93 rescale makes the music slightly smaller than the page (centred)."
 },
